# Project Guidelines

- Make sure there are not silent fails. Fail loudly everywhere! Don't skip it for convenience, solve it so it doesn't fail!
- When I ask for an explanation or analysis do not write md or txt documents, answer in chat directly
- The project uses pipenv for dependency management
- When running Python commands, use `pipenv run python3` or activate the pipenv environment firsta